LibxmlNode -- the class of all XML nodes created by libxml2
***********************************************************

Description
===========



Each XML node created by libxml2 has: if it is an element (as determined by
*note xmlIsElement: xmlIsElement_lpLibxmlNode_rp,), an optional element name,
which is a string and is obtained with *note xmlGetName: xmlGetName,; if it is
text (as determined by *note xmlIsText: xmlIsText_lpLibxmlNode_rp,), an
optional content string, obtained with *note xmlGetContent:
xmlGetContent_lpLibxmlNode_rp,; a linked list of attributes of type *note
LibxmlAttribute: LibxmlAttribute,; a linked list of children (which are XML
nodes), obtained with *note xmlFirstChild: xmlFirstChild,; and a pointer its
next sibling, obtained with *note xmlGetNext: xmlGetNext,.

XML nodes are mutable.

Internally, a pointer to the XML document containing the node accompanies the
node.

Let's use *note xmlParse: xmlParse_lpString_rp, to make an XML node.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : n = xmlParse ///<foo> aabc <bar id="foo" name="too"> asdf </bar><coo/>< |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = <foo> aabc <bar id="foo" name="too"> asdf </bar><coo/><coo>hi</coo><coo |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : LibxmlNode (xmlTypeDescription)                                         |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|coo>hi</coo><coo a="b">hi</coo></foo>///                                     |
|                                                                             |
| a="b">hi</coo></foo>                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : xmlIsElement n, xmlIsText n                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = (true, false)                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Since it is an element, we may use *note xmlGetName: xmlGetName, to get its
name.

+-----------------+
|i3 : xmlGetName n|
|                 |
|o3 = foo         |
+-----------------+

We use *note xmlFirstChild: xmlFirstChild, to get the first node in the linked
list of children, which happens to be text:

+------------------------------------+
|i4 : c = xmlFirstChild n            |
|                                    |
|o4 = " aabc "                       |
|                                    |
|o4 : LibxmlNode (xmlTypeDescription)|
+------------------------------------+
|i5 : xmlIsElement c, xmlIsText c    |
|                                    |
|o5 = (false, true)                  |
|                                    |
|o5 : Sequence                       |
+------------------------------------+

We may follow the linked list of children of n.

+------------------------------------------+
|i6 : c                                    |
|                                          |
|o6 = " aabc "                             |
|                                          |
|o6 : LibxmlNode (xmlTypeDescription)      |
+------------------------------------------+
|i7 : bar = xmlGetNext oo                  |
|                                          |
|o7 = <bar id="foo" name="too"> asdf </bar>|
|                                          |
|o7 : LibxmlNode (xmlTypeDescription)      |
+------------------------------------------+
|i8 : xmlGetNext oo                        |
|                                          |
|o8 = <coo/>                               |
|                                          |
|o8 : LibxmlNode (xmlTypeDescription)      |
+------------------------------------------+
|i9 : xmlGetNext oo                        |
|                                          |
|o9 = <coo>hi</coo>                        |
|                                          |
|o9 : LibxmlNode (xmlTypeDescription)      |
+------------------------------------------+
|i10 : xmlGetNext oo                       |
|                                          |
|o10 = <coo a="b">hi</coo>                 |
|                                          |
|o10 : LibxmlNode (xmlTypeDescription)     |
+------------------------------------------+
|i11 : xmlGetNext oo                       |
+------------------------------------------+

Let's examine the attributes of bar.

+---------------------------+
|i12 : xmlFirstAttribute bar|
|                           |
|o12 = id = "foo"           |
|                           |
|o12 : LibxmlAttribute      |
+---------------------------+
|i13 : a = xmlGetNext oo    |
|                           |
|o13 = name = "too"         |
|                           |
|o13 : LibxmlAttribute      |
+---------------------------+
|i14 : xmlGetNext oo        |
+---------------------------+

We may disassemble an attribute as follows.

+-------------------------------------+
|i15 : xmlGetName a                   |
|                                     |
|o15 = name                           |
+-------------------------------------+
|i16 : b = xmlFirstChild a            |
|                                     |
|o16 = "too"                          |
|                                     |
|o16 : LibxmlNode (xmlTypeDescription)|
+-------------------------------------+
|i17 : xmlGetNext oo                  |
+-------------------------------------+
|i18 : xmlIsText b                    |
|                                     |
|o18 = true                           |
+-------------------------------------+
|i19 : toString b                     |
|                                     |
|o19 = too                            |
+-------------------------------------+

There are other functions that retrieve the entire list of attributes or
children.

+---------------------------------------------+
|i20 : getChildren n                          |
|                                             |
|o20 = {" aabc "                             }|
|      {<bar id="foo" name="too"> asdf </bar>}|
|      {<coo/>                               }|
|      {<coo>hi</coo>                        }|
|      {<coo a="b">hi</coo>                  }|
|                                             |
|o20 : VerticalList                           |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i21 : class \ oo                             |
|                                             |
|o21 = {LibxmlNode}                           |
|      {LibxmlNode}                           |
|      {LibxmlNode}                           |
|      {LibxmlNode}                           |
|      {LibxmlNode}                           |
|                                             |
|o21 : VerticalList                           |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i22 : getAttributes bar                      |
|                                             |
|o22 = {id = "foo"  }                         |
|      {name = "too"}                         |
|                                             |
|o22 : VerticalList                           |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i23 : class \ oo                             |
|                                             |
|o23 = {LibxmlAttribute}                      |
|      {LibxmlAttribute}                      |
|                                             |
|o23 : VerticalList                           |
+---------------------------------------------+

