  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note LibxmlNode: LibxmlNode,, 

Description
===========

+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : new XMLnode from {                                  |
|          tag => "foo",                                  |
|          children => {                                  |
|               new XMLnode from {                        |
