toXMLnode(LibxmlNode) -- convert an object of type LibxmlNode to a hashtable of type XMLnode
********************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note toXMLnode: toXMLnode_lpLibxmlNode_rp,
  * Usage: 
        toXMLnode n
  * Inputs:
      * n, an instance of the type *note LibxmlNode: LibxmlNode,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Trim => ..., default value true
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note XMLnode: XMLnode,, a representation of
        the XML tree represented by n
      * Trim => a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, default value
        true, whether to trim leading and trailing spaces from the lines in
        text nodes

Description
===========

This function translates an XML tree created by the libxml library into a tree
of hash tables of type *note XMLnode: XMLnode,.

+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : n = xmlParse ///<foo a="hi there">  ho there  <bar/></foo>///|
|                                                                  |
|o1 = <foo a="hi there">  ho there  <bar/></foo>                   |
|                                                                  |
|o1 : LibxmlNode (xmlTypeDescription)                              |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : x = toXMLnode n                                              |
|                                                                  |
|o2 = <foo a="hi there"                                            |
|       "ho there"                                                 |
|       <bar                                                       |
|                                                                  |
|o2 : XMLnode                                                      |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : peek'_3 x                                                    |
|                                                                  |
|o3 = XMLnode{"a" => "hi there"                              }     |
|             children => {"ho there", XMLnode{tag => "bar"}}      |
|             tag => "foo"                                         |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : x#"a"                                                        |
|                                                                  |
|o4 = hi there                                                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : x.children                                                   |
|                                                                  |
|o5 = {ho there, <bar}                                             |
|                                                                  |
|o5 : List                                                         |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : class \ oo                                                   |
|                                                                  |
|o6 = {String, XMLnode}                                            |
|                                                                  |
|o6 : List                                                         |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : x.tag                                                        |
|                                                                  |
|o7 = foo                                                          |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : x = toXMLnode(n,Trim=>false)                                 |
|                                                                  |
|o8 = <foo a="hi there"                                            |
|       "  ho there  "                                             |
|       <bar                                                       |
|                                                                  |
|o8 : XMLnode                                                      |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note xmlParse: xmlParse_lpString_rp, -- parse a string containing XML

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note toXMLnode(LibxmlNode): toXMLnode_lpLibxmlNode_rp, -- convert an
    object of type LibxmlNode to a hashtable of type XMLnode
