XMLnode -- the class of all XML trees created by the library libxml2
********************************************************************

Description
===========

An object of class *note XMLnode: XMLnode, is a hashtable used to contain a
representation of a node in an XML tree.

Each such hashtable represents a node of the tree, in which: the keys that are
strings provide the values of attributes; the symbol children provides the list
of children, each of which is a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String, or an
instance of the type *note XMLnode: XMLnode,; and the symbol tag provides the
name of the element.

Currently, only element nodes and text nodes are implemented.



+-------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : new XMLnode from {                                |
|          tag => "foo",                                |
|          children => {                                |
|               new XMLnode from {                      |
|                    tag => "bar",                      |
|                    children => { " chicken coop " } },|
|               " hi there ",                           |
|               new XMLnode from { tag => "bar" } } }   |
|                                                       |
|o1 = <foo                                              |
|       <bar " chicken coop "                           |
|       " hi there "                                    |
|       <bar                                            |
|                                                       |
|o1 : XMLnode                                           |
+-------------------------------------------------------+

Functions and methods returning an object of class XMLnode:
===========================================================

  * "parse" -- see *note parse(String): parse_lpString_rp, -- parse XML

Methods that use an object of class XMLnode:
============================================

  * *note toLibxmlNode(XMLnode): toLibxmlNode_lpXMLnode_rp, -- convert a
    hashtable of type XMLnode to an object of type LibxmlNode

For the programmer
==================

The object *note XMLnode: XMLnode, is a *note type: (Macaulay2Doc)Type,, with
ancestor classes *note MutableHashTable: (Macaulay2Doc)MutableHashTable, <
