xmlTypeDescription(LibxmlNode) -- the type description for an XML node
**********************************************************************

  * Function: *note xmlTypeDescription: xmlTypeDescription_lpLibxmlNode_rp,
  * Usage: 
        xmlTypeDescription n
  * Inputs:
      * n, an instance of the type *note LibxmlNode: LibxmlNode,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, the description of the type of n

Description
===========

+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : xmlParse "<foo>the cat<bar/><!-- a comment--></foo>"|
|                                                         |
|o1 = <foo>the cat<bar/><!-- a comment--></foo>           |
|                                                         |
|o1 : LibxmlNode (xmlTypeDescription)                     |
+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : getChildren oo                                      |
|                                                         |
|o2 = {"the cat"        }                                 |
|     {<bar/>           }                                 |
|     {<!-- a comment-->}                                 |
|                                                         |
|o2 : VerticalList                                        |
+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : xmlTypeDescription \ oo                             |
|                                                         |
|o3 = {text node   }                                      |
|     {element node}                                      |
|     {comment node}                                      |
|                                                         |
|o3 : VerticalList                                        |
+---------------------------------------------------------+

